    "text": {
     "en": "Conservation means protecting and saving something, such as water.\nContainers are things that hold something. Overhead means above our heads.\nUnique means one of a kind. Culture is the way of life of a group of people. Concrete is a hard building material made from cement, sand and stones. Heritage is what we inherit from the past, like traditions and old buildings.\nContractions: aren't, wouldn't, can't, couldn't, didn't.\nUse each word in a sentence."
    }
